'''Madam Peng''' (ミセス・ペン, ''Misesu Pen'', '''Mrs. Pen''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]] variant of [[Jackie Peng]] introduced in [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]] stages. She was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Madam Peng
|image = E 752.png
|first appearance = [[Anniversary/13th Year#Ep. 1: Heroes of Justice!|Ep. 1: Heroes of Justice!]]
