==Enemy==
A dastardly villainess with access to an [[Omni Strike]] that pierces up to 180 range, in spite of her low standing range of 130. Her 33% [[Freeze]] is guaranteed to render any melee units caught in her effective range completely incapacitated nigh-permanently thanks to her fast attack rate. Be wary not to take this threat too lightly as a result!

==Strategy==
Madam Peng is outranged by both [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Ranger]] and [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Ranger]], rendering her a non-issue with the right combination of [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]]. Tank her attacks with [[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Yellow Nyanko Ranger]], or any good meatshield, and use her as a platform to snipe incoming enemy units. Even at her highest strength magnifications, there is little reason to worry so long as you bring good midrangers like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]]. Don't underestimate her surprisingly high DPS in later encounters, though...

