==Trivia==
*Madam Peng is actually the second [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Jackie Peng]]. The first was the [[Media:Blackpengship.png|Dark UFO Peng]] from [[Nyanko Defence Force]].
*Madam Peng's Japanese name (ミセス・ペン, ''Misesu Pen'', "Mrs. Pen") implies that she is married to one of the other Pengs (Pens in Japanese), as the honorific ''Mrs.'' is used for women who are or have been married.
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], Madam Peng's lipstick is red, whereas in every other version it's black. She shares this trait with [[Countess Koryessa]] and [[High Countess Koryessa]].
**This change was likely to prevent them from resembling blackface, a practice originating in American theater in which performers would heavily darken their skin and exaggerate their lips (usually via applying bright red or pink lipstick) to portray a highly offensive caricature of Africans.

